    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="namespacetle92466ed_1_1GLOBAL__DIAG0" kindref="compound">GLOBAL_DIAG0</ref> register bit definitions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Global diagnosis register for supply voltages, reset events, and faults.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Bit Map:</title><para><verbatim>* Bit 14  : SPI_WD_ERR  - SPI watchdog error
* Bit 10  : POR_EVENT   - Power-on reset event
* Bit 9   : RES_EVENT   - Reset event (RESN pin)
* Bit 8   : COTWARN     - Central over-temp warning
* Bit 7   : COTERR      - Central over-temp error
* Bit 6   : CLK_NOK     - Clock fault
* Bit 5   : VDD_OV      - VDD overvoltage
* Bit 4   : VDD_UV      - VDD undervoltage
* Bit 3   : VIO_OV      - VIO overvoltage
* Bit 2   : VIO_UV      - VIO undervoltage
* Bit 1   : VBAT_OV     - VBAT overvoltage
* Bit 0   : VBAT_UV     - VBAT undervoltage
* </verbatim></para>
</simplesect>
Default: 0x0600 </para>
    </detaileddescription>
